 fine=GEN,
 cap="Brampton condo rules. Your plans allowed?\n\nBuying a condo in Brampton? Before you go firm, ask these questions: 1) Ask for the condo's declaration, by-laws and rules. 2) Check the pet, rental and short-term rental rules against your plans. 3) Ask about renovation limits, and how parking and lockers work. 4) Ask your lawyer to review the documents before your conditions end. These are planning questions, not rules, and every condo is different.\n\nBuying a condo in Brampton? "+INFO+"\n\n"+GEN,
